  "Id": 222,
  "Title": "SONAM video gets honorable mention at ASM Global Video Challenge",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Although we are not among the winners, reaching this stage at a global contest is also a wonderful achievement, for which everyone involved deserves appreciation",
  "GlobalNews": true,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass07130166BBE046D7B82D87CBEB2FFAC9\"><div>The American Society for Microbiology \u2013 world\u2019s largest scientific society of individuals interested in the microbiological sciences \u2013 hosted the <a href=\"http&#58;//www.asm.org/index.php/2015-gvc-winners\" target=\"_blank\">Global Video Challenge</a> recently, asking its members to submit videos highlighting myths in science and what\u2019s being done to disprove them.</div><div><br></div><div>The faculty members teaching Sciences at the Aga Khan University\u2019s School of Nursing and Midwifery in Karachi participated in the contest. The video rose above the rest for its quality and creative approach in answering the question, and was awarded an \u2018honorable mention\u2019.</div><div><br></div><div>\u201cAlthough we are not among the winners, reaching this stage at a global contest is also a wonderful achievement, for which everyone involved deserves appreciation,\u201d said Raisa Gul, Professor and Interim Dean, SONAM.</div><div><br></div><div>The faculty involved in the video included Fatima Kubra, Shehla Khan and Naghma Rizvi with the technical assistance.</div></div>",
